              "instruction": "ondu vēḷe magu kāṇeyādare appa amma takṣaṇa dūru koḍuttāre. — If a child goes missing, the parents report it at once.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *ondu vēḷe magu kāṇeyādare appa amma takṣaṇa dūru koḍuttāre.* — If a child goes missing, the parents report it at once.]"
