          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪತ್ತೆ ಹಚ್ಚು — patte haccu — \"to track down; to detect\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪೊಲೀಸರು ಎರಡು ದಿನದಲ್ಲಿ ಮಗುವನ್ನು ಪತ್ತೆ ಹಚ್ಚಿದರು. polīsaru eraḍu dinadalli maguvannu patte haccidaru. The police tracked down the child in two days."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಪತ್ತೆ ಹಚ್ಚಿದೆ, patte haccide."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪತ್ತೆ is a trace; ಪತ್ತೆಯಾಗು means to be found."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪತ್ತೆ ಹಚ್ಚು (patte haccu) is a Kannada phrase verb built from ಪತ್ತೆ, \"a trace, a whereabouts\", and ಹಚ್ಚು, \"to apply, to light\". The origin of ಪತ್ತೆ is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
